{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"a5a70844ec3539cc","__entryId":"flex","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div>\n      <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);position:relative;margin-top:10px\">\n        <span class=\"flex-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:12px\">开启弹性布局后子元素默认沿水平主轴排列</span>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:10px 14px\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/logo.svg\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px\" alt=\"\">\n          <b style=\"font-size:13px\">Vibe 图鉴</b>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand);font-weight:600\">组件</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">术语</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">场景</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1\"></span>\n          <img src=\"/assets/avatar-robot.png\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%\" alt=\"\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex-sc-note\">logo、链接、头像都交给 flex 横排对齐</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:280px;margin:10px auto 0;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:14px;position:relative\">\n      <span class=\"flex-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:12px\">flex-direction: column</span>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n        <label style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">昵称<input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:4px;padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px\" value=\"小林\"></label>\n        <label style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">邮箱<input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:4px;padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px\" value=\"lin@example.com\"></label>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"align-self:flex-end;padding:5px 14px;font-size:12px\">保存资料</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;position:relative;margin-top:10px\">\n      <span class=\"flex-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:12px\">justify-content: space-between</span>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px\">项目动态</b>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-text\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:3px 6px\">查看全部 →</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);margin-top:8px\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%\" alt=\"\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;flex:1;color:var(--text-2)\">小狐狸 更新了「首页改版」</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">10:24</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"height:130px;border:1.5px dashed var(--brand);border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;background:var(--bg-soft);margin-top:10px\">\n      <span class=\"flex-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:12px\">align-items + justify-content: center</span>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/empty-box.png\" style=\"width:46px;height:36px;object-fit:contain\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:3px\">暂无消息，内容在两条轴上居中</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div>\n      <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);position:relative;margin-top:10px\">\n        <span class=\"flex-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:12px\">display: flex · horizontal row</span>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:10px 14px\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/logo.svg\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px\" alt=\"\">\n          <b style=\"font-size:13px\">VibeHub</b>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand);font-weight:600\">Components</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Terms</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Examples</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1\"></span>\n          <img src=\"/assets/avatar-robot.png\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%\" alt=\"\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex-sc-note\">Flex keeps the logo, links, and avatar aligned in one row</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:280px;margin:10px auto 0;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:14px;position:relative\">\n      <span class=\"flex-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:12px\">flex-direction: column</span>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n        <label style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Nickname<input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:4px;padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px\" value=\"Xiao Lin\"></label>\n        <label style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Email<input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:4px;padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px\" value=\"lin@example.com\"></label>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"align-self:flex-end;padding:5px 14px;font-size:12px\">Save data</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;position:relative;margin-top:10px\">\n      <span class=\"flex-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:12px\">justify-content: space-between</span>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px\">Project News</b>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-text\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:3px 6px\">View all →</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);margin-top:8px\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%\" alt=\"\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;flex:1;color:var(--text-2)\">Little Fox has updated the \"Home Page Revision\"</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">10:24</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"height:130px;border:1.5px dashed var(--brand);border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;background:var(--bg-soft);margin-top:10px\">\n      <span class=\"flex-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:12px\">align-items + justify-content: center</span>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/empty-box.png\" style=\"width:46px;height:36px;object-fit:contain\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:3px\">No news yet, the content is centered on both axes</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"container\"><span class=\"flex-anat-box\"><span class=\"flex-anat-item\"></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"item\"><span class=\"flex-anat-item\">项目</span></span><span class=\"flex-anat-item\"></span></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"main\"><span class=\"flex-anat-axis\">主轴 →</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"cross\"><span class=\"flex-anat-axis\">交叉轴 ↓</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"container\"><span class=\"flex-anat-box\"><span class=\"flex-anat-item\"></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"item\"><span class=\"flex-anat-item\">item</span></span><span class=\"flex-anat-item\"></span></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"main\"><span class=\"flex-anat-axis\">Main axis →</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"cross\"><span class=\"flex-anat-axis\">Cross axis ↓</span></span>","parts":[{"key":"container","cn":"弹性容器","en":"Container","desc":"写上 display: flex 的那个父元素","desc_en":"The parent element with display: flex written on it"},{"key":"item","cn":"弹性项目","en":"Item","desc":"容器里的直接子元素","desc_en":"direct child elements in the container"},{"key":"main","cn":"主轴","en":"Main Axis","desc":"项目的排列方向，由 justify-content 控制分布与间距","desc_en":"The arrangement direction of items; controlled by justify-content"},{"key":"cross","cn":"交叉轴","en":"Cross Axis","desc":"垂直于主轴方向的副轴对齐，由 align-items 控制。","desc_en":"Cross axis alignment perpendicular to the main axis; controlled by align-items."}]},"variants":[{"cn":"横排","en":"Row","demo":"<div style=\"display:flex;gap:5px\"><span class=\"flex-v\"></span><span class=\"flex-v\"></span><span class=\"flex-v\"></span></div>","demo_en":"<div style=\"display:flex;gap:5px\"><span class=\"flex-v\"></span><span class=\"flex-v\"></span><span class=\"flex-v\"></span></div>","when":"默认主轴为水平方向；内容需要沿同一行流动时选择","when_en":"The default main axis is horizontal; select it when the content needs to flow along the same line."},{"cn":"竖排","en":"Column","demo":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px\"><span class=\"flex-v\"></span><span class=\"flex-v\"></span><span class=\"flex-v\"></span></div>","demo_en":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px\"><span class=\"flex-v\"></span><span class=\"flex-v\"></span><span class=\"flex-v\"></span></div>","when":"主轴改为垂直方向；内容顺序应自上而下时选择","when_en":"The main axis is changed to vertical direction; select when the content order should be from top to bottom."},{"cn":"居中","en":"Center","demo":"<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:92px;height:44px;border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:6px\"><span class=\"flex-v\"></span></div>","demo_en":"<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:92px;height:44px;border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:6px\"><span class=\"flex-v\"></span></div>","when":"在容器尺寸明确时，把两条轴上的剩余空间分配到内容两侧","when_en":"When the container size is clear, allocate the remaining space on both axes to both sides of the content"},{"cn":"两端对齐","en":"SpaceBetween","demo":"<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;width:92px\"><span class=\"flex-v\"></span><span class=\"flex-v\"></span></div>","demo_en":"<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;width:92px\"><span class=\"flex-v\"></span><span class=\"flex-v\"></span></div>","when":"把主轴剩余空间放到项目之间；适合两端需要贴边的排列","when_en":"Place the remaining space on the main axis between items; suitable for arrangements that require welting at both ends"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>导航横排</b>：菜单项、工具栏、按钮组排一行","m":"flex-row"},{"t":"<b>竖向堆叠</b>：{c:form} 字段、列表项用 column","m":"flex-column"},{"t":"<b>水平垂直居中</b>：登录区、空状态等单一内容可在明确尺寸的容器中居中","m":"flex-center"},{"t":"<b>两端对齐</b>：标题靠左、操作靠右用 space-between","m":"flex-between"}],"dont":[{"t":"用 <b>float + clearfix</b> 构建常规一维排列：需要额外清除浮动，Flex 通常更清晰","m":"flex-float","bad":true},{"t":"<b>多行多列对齐</b>的卡片墙通常使用 {c:grid}","m":"flex-vs-grid"},{"t":"子元素宽度全写死还不换行，<b>直接溢出容器</b>","m":"flex-overflow","bad":true},{"t":"未设置 flex-wrap: wrap：内容变多时会被压缩或溢出","m":"flex-nowrap","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"工具栏只有一行：标题靠左，数量会变化的操作按钮靠右，并保持垂直居中。怎样布局最直接？","options":[{"id":"absolute-actions","label":"让按钮绝对定位到右侧，再逐个调整 top 数值","feedback":"按钮脱离正常排列后，标题或按钮数量变化容易重叠，垂直对齐也要反复手调。","correct":false},{"id":"flex-toolbar","label":"父级使用 Flex，两端分布并设置交叉轴居中","feedback":"这是沿一条主轴排列的关系；Flex 能让两组内容自然分居两端，并统一垂直对齐。","correct":true},{"id":"fixed-margins","label":"给标题和每个按钮写固定外边距，把它们推到目标位置","feedback":"固定距离只适配当前文字和按钮数量，内容变化后不能继续保持两端关系。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A toolbar has one row: a title on the left and a changing number of actions on the right, all vertically centered. Which layout is most direct?","options":[{"id":"absolute-actions","label":"Absolutely position the actions on the right and tune each top value","feedback":"Removing actions from normal flow makes overlap likely when the title or action count changes.","correct":false},{"id":"flex-toolbar","label":"Use Flex on the parent, distribute both sides, and center the cross axis","feedback":"This is a one-axis relationship. Flex keeps the two groups at opposite ends and aligns them vertically.","correct":true},{"id":"fixed-margins","label":"Give the title and every action fixed margins until they reach the target positions","feedback":"Fixed distances only fit the current content and stop preserving the relationship when text or actions change.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请用 Flex 整理工具栏：标题在左，操作组在右，整体垂直居中；按钮数量变化时仍保持两端关系。窄屏放不下时允许合理换行，不要用绝对定位或固定外边距硬推。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Use Flex for the toolbar with the title on the left, actions on the right, and vertical centering. Preserve that relationship as actions change, and allow sensible wrapping when narrow. Do not force placement with absolute positioning or fixed margins."}},"references":[{"title":"Flexbox 弹性布局","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/CSS_layout/Flexbox","title_en":"Flexbox"},{"title":"Flexbox 完整指南","source":"CSS-Tricks","url":"https://css-tricks.com/snippets/css/a-guide-to-flexbox/","title_en":"A Complete Guide to CSS Flexbox"}],"scenes":["导航栏横排","表单字段竖排","标题与操作分居两端","内容垂直居中"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Align items in a row","m":"flex-row"},{"t":"Build a vertical stack","m":"flex-column"},{"t":"Distribute space between controls","m":"flex-center"},{"t":"Let items wrap when room runs out","m":"flex-between"}],"dont":[{"t":"Use many nested flex containers for a simple grid","m":"flex-float","bad":true},{"t":"Set fixed widths that fight the flexible layout","m":"flex-vs-grid"},{"t":"Forget how the order changes on small screens","m":"flex-overflow","bad":true},{"t":"Use visual order that differs from keyboard and reading order","m":"flex-nowrap","bad":true}],"scenes":["Toolbar","Navigation row","Form actions","Card header"],"sceneUI":["<div>\n      <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;