p\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:12px\">justify-content: space-between</span>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px\">Project News</b>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-text\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:3px 6px\">View all →</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);margin-top:8px\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%\" alt=\"\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;flex:1;color:var(--text-2)\">Little Fox has updated the \"Home Page Revision\"</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">10:24</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"height:130px;border:1.5px dashed var(--brand);border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;background:var(--bg-soft);margin-top:10px\">\n      <span class=\"flex-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:12px\">align-items + justify-content: center</span>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/empty-box.png\" style=\"width:46px;height:36px;object-fit:contain\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:3px\">No news yet, the content is centered on both axes</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"variants":[{"demo":"<div style=\"display:flex;gap:5px\"><span class=\"flex-v\"></span><span class=\"flex-v\"></span><span class=\"flex-v\"></span></div>","when":"The default main axis is horizontal; select it when the content needs to flow along the same line."},{"demo":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px\"><span class=\"flex-v\"></span><span class=\"flex-v\"></span><span class=\"flex-v\"></span></div>","when":"The main axis is changed to vertical direction; select when the content order should be from top to bottom."},{"demo":"<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:92px;height:44px;border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:6px\"><span class=\"flex-v\"></span></div>","when":"When the container size is clear, allocate the remaining space on both axes to both sides of the content"},{"demo":"<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;width:92px\"><span class=\"flex-v\"></span><span class=\"flex-v\"></span></div>","when":"Place the remaining space on the main axis between items; suitable for arrangements that require welting at both ends"}]},"usageMocks":{"flex-row":"<div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%;justify-content:flex-start;gap:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">首页</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">组件</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">术语</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">display: flex 默认沿水平方向排列直接子元素</span>","flex-column":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"gap:7px\"><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"width:100%\">姓名</span><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"width:100%\">邮箱</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">flex-direction: column 改为垂直排列</span></div>","flex-center":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"align-items:center\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">登录</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">主轴与交叉轴都设为 center</span></div>","flex-between":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row between\" style=\"width:100%\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">项目动态</span><span class=\"mk-btn text\" style=\"font-size:12px\">查看全部</span></div></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">space-between：标题靠左，操作靠右</span>","flex-float":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"float:left;font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">左浮动</span><span style=\"float:right;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">右浮动</span><span style=\"clear:both;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">用于常规排列时还需额外清除浮动</span></div>","flex-vs-grid":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,18px);gap:3px\"><span style=\"height:14px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"height:14px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"height:14px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"height:14px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"height:14px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"height:14px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:2px\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);max-width:120px\">需要同时控制行列关系时，Grid 通常更直接</span></div>","flex-overflow":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"overflow:hidden\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:nowrap\"><span style=\"width:44px;height:16px;flex:none;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px\"></span><span style=\"width:44px;height:16px;flex:none;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px\"></span><span style=\"width:44px;height:16px;flex:none;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px\"></span><span style=\"width:44px;height:16px;flex:none;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:3px\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">固定宽度且禁止换行时，子元素可能溢出容器</span></div>","flex-nowrap":"<div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:nowrap;overflow:hidden;width:100%\"><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">标签一</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">标签二</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">标签三</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">标签四</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">标签五</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">标签六</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">未设置 flex-wrap，标签空间不足而压缩</span>"}}}